    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "EM Scanlon Auctioneers and Estate Agents, is proud to present this substantial family home standing proud on C.1.4 acres with large detached garage unit situated just 2 kms from the university hospital, ATU and Sligo city within walking distance from the popular local Sudbury school. As you approach this impressive family home up a long-shared driveway you get a sense of the scale of the mature private grounds cleverly planted with love and care by its present owner.\n\nAs you enter inside you are welcomed by a spacious porch and entrance hallway, cosy sitting room with bay window and feature open fireplace, formal dining room with bay window, feature open fireplace and a door leading to the kitchen, well equipped kitchen with extensive range of fitted units, second living room with solid fuel stove & a sliding door to the rear, handy utility room and separate wc.\n\nOn the first floor are five fine sized bedrooms (three with ensuites) a main house bathroom and large landing. The attic is easily accessed from the landing via a stira stairs and is well floored out and it has a large skylight letting in great natural light.\n\nTo the rear of the residence is a spacious private paved patio that links well with the house and rear garden and a large detached garage unit that has the potential for many different uses including, workshop, studio or granny flat accommodation subject to planning. The unit is totally detached & independent from the main residence and has huge potential to be more than what it is currently.\n\nThe grounds of this impressive residence span to approximately 1.4 acres and are a truly special feature with beautifully planted mature trees and shrubberies providing a haven of peace and an oasis of calm which contribute to a sense of complete seclusion from the world yet only 2km from Sligo. \n\nViewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate the convenient location all that this home has to offer.\n\nJoint agents - Sherry FitzGerald Draper, Sligo.\n\n\nServices \nMains water.\nSeptic Tank on site.\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Porch (9.84ft x 5.58ft) Tiled flooring<br>Entrance Hall (18.04ft x 7.22ft) Wooden flooring, staircase with understairs storage<br>Kitchen (15.09ft x 12.80ft) extensive range of fitted kitchen units, tiled flooring, door to dining room.<br>Utility Room (7.87ft x 4.92ft) Fitted units with sink, tiled flooring, fitted storage unit, door to rear patio and garden<br>WC (4.59ft x 3.61ft) wc, wash hand basin, wall and floor tiling<br>Dining Room (14.76ft x 13.12ft) Bay window, feature open fireplace, coving and centre piece, door to kitchen<br>Sitting Room (15.09ft x 13.12ft) Bay window, feature open fireplace, coving and centre piece, door to kitchen<br>Living Room (14.76ft x 12.80ft) Solid fuel stove, sliding door to the patio, tiled flooring, centre piece<br>Landing (14.44ft x 3.28ft) <br>Landing (7.87ft x 3.61ft) Hotpress<br>Landing (5.25ft x 3.61ft) Stira stairs to a large floor-attic space with skylight<br>Bedroom 1 (12.80ft x 11.81ft) Built in wardrobes<br>En-suite (6.23ft x 4.27ft) Wc, wash hand basin, shower.<br>Bedroom 2 (13.12ft x 12.80ft) Wash hand basin, built in wardrobe, mountain views<br>En-suite (3.94ft x 5.25ft) Wall and floor tiling, wc, wash hand basin, shower<br>Bedroom 3 (9.19ft x 7.87ft) Built in wardrobe and mountain views<br>En-suite (3.28ft x 6.56ft) <br>Bedroom 4 (12.80ft x 10.83ft) Built in wardrobe and wash hand basin<br>Bedroom 5 (14.76ft x 11.81ft) Built in wardrobe, wash hand basin, mountain views<br>Bathroom (7.55ft x 6.56ft) Wc, wash hand basin, shower, bath, wall and floor tiling<br>Garage (19.69ft x 15.42ft) Open garage area <br>Garage (15.75ft x 15.09ft) Internal room with stairs to loft storage area<br>Garage (19.69ft x 15.42ft) Internal room 3 "
